			<key>Key</key>
			<string>zenModeEnabled</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>Zen Mode</string>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>FooterText</key>
			<string>What each gesture does, anywhere on the screen. The two groups at the bottom of this list can override the one-finger gestures for the strip above the sheet and the band below it; everywhere else — the page itself included — these apply.

Two gestures may hold the same action, and any gesture may be set to Nothing.

The side rocker (Up / Down) steps text size inside a book on this build — holding a side button changes the reading font — and scrolls a screenful elsewhere.</string>
			<key>Title</key>
			<string>Gestures — One Finger</string>
			<key>Type</key>
			<string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
		</dict>
